{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "さむいねぇ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都からぽつぽつブログを書いています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもね\n最近メジロを見かけるし､スーパーによく熟れた苺が並ぶようになったの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "春はすぐそこかも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だいぶお久しぶりになりました〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あるのです☺"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はリアルミーグリとリアルサイン会ありがとうございましたっっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/260201_1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/260201_2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "髪も暗くなったのでなんだかすかした雰囲気\nブルーブラックという髪色らしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/260201_3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花たちもありがとう〜〜〜\nかわいすぎる💐💐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すこしばかり近況のことも。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂スター誕生！SIX LIVEにゲストとして出演させていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鈴木佑捺ちゃんとSUPER BEAVERさんの「小さな革命」を歌えたこと､とても特別に思っています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たちの想いは、本番の歌と姿勢に\n全て残ってます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佑捺ちゃん、ずっと歌好きでいてほしいなあ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんたくさん歌っててほしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩だからとか、メンバーとして\nとかそういうのじゃなくて\n私がそう思うの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生みーんな！！\nいっぱいしあわせでいろ〜〜〜っっ！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心からの願い！！🤞"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂工事中🚧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たちは絶賛新年会中でございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の目標の1つ！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "工事中でいっぱい笑うことっっ！\nほんでもって､バナナマンさんにもいっぱい笑ってもらうこと！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂工事中が\n誰かの乃木坂46の入り口であれるように☺"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣をきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/260201_4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/260201_5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が茶髪であったことをここに記す"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近の気になる映画"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アグリーシスター\nヒグマ‼\nおさるのベン\nほどなく､お別れです\nTGETHER"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "配信待ちしちゃうの、私の悪い癖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年はたくさん映画館に足を運ぼう〜と思っております。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに､配信で映画を見たとしても"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "エンドロールまできっちり見る派です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それが作り手への最低限のリスペクトだっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて良いように思ってたけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "じつは、映画館へ行かないことへの罪滅ぼしなのかもと思ったり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんな事を考えてるあたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたし変わってないなあ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも\n変わったところも､変われたところも､変わらないところも\n好き……とまではいかないけど嫌いじゃない"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それってなんか進歩かも〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんか湿っぽくなったので\n私の好きなエンドロールを紹介して今日のブログは終わります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『Pearl パール』\nナイススマイルエンドロール"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『ゾンビ津波』\n爆速エンドロール"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『関心領域』\n最高で最恐の拷問エンドロール"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よければ見てみてください\nみんなが好きなのもあれば教えてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほいじゃ！\nまた書きます〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🍣🧑‍🎨🩵👘🩰🍅🎤⛸️👩‍✈️🐶🦎"}], "source": "official"}